@EmmanuelMacron
 In 1978, Paris hosted Khomeini. In 1979, Air France flew him to Tehran enabling his revolution. In 2026, Iranians are still paying the price: many thousands slaughtered. Don’t now stand in the way of ending the evil regime—or of putting them on the EU terror list

